==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is pretty easy. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]'s level 7 wave allows it to just snipe everything here, and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] removes Capy from existence. Add Holy Blast for Miss Haka and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] for the Zuches and this stage is a free win.

If you own [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]], you can add it to your lineup for extra security against Miss Haka.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 5,500. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

